        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9f539375-4294-4ca9-8d6a-7884edd561d7\",\"review_text\":\"i want to give it 5 star but the dissappearance of lyrics disappointed me i tried to search it on google and tried to do what they said but nothing works i think this is a problem of Spotify itself, lyrics got changed by an about an artist, i saw on the others that they can change it but mine there was no option where i could change it. please fix it i really like listening to music while reading the lyrics.\"},{\"review_id\":\"53e34eaf-b9e8-4aca-b841-a36d48ede6cc\",\"review_text\":\"Great platform for music and podcasts\"},{\"review_id\":\"fd364552-20d1-4a97-8d62-d1671b58cc1b\",\"review_text\":\"Charge to much for the people who are on a fixed income!!!R.J. and Retired? Why??\"},{\"review_id\":\"7d8121f0-3908-48bd-b278-a2f69dc6761b\",\"review_text\":\"Maayo ug nindot Ang mga sonata\"},{\"review_id\":\"9948ecb5-c40c-4ad3-8312-83ea530b32a0\",\"review_text\":\"✨🙈🌚\"},{\"review_id\":\"ca8704f4-b3b0-4733-b152-04301e4a0bb4\",\"review_text\":\"Brilliant app works perfect for me\"},{\"review_id\":\"f16f7bb3-4593-45f0-aa8f-502120c3d25d\",\"review_text\":\"👌👌👌👌👌👌👌👌nice perfect👌👌👌👌👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"be9f3fdc-faed-434f-8d0e-a13719fbe704\",\"review_text\":\"ON THIN ICE, SPOTIFY I have been using Spotify since 2015 and generally, I've loved it once I got premium. However, today I opened it up to play my music and was immediately bombarded by autoplaying suggestions on my home page. NOT cool. If this new feature (experiencing on Android as of 3/16/23) isn't removed or greatly diminished soon, I'll have to migrate my listening elsewhere. Do not tiktokify my music library, dudes. I hate this feature & will not hesitate to leave the platform.\"},{\"review_id\":\"6991cd17-7395-4383-9f2b-d52c40fc0e06\",\"review_text\":\"It was the best platform to listen and stream any music until the latest update. Like now it becomes so worst and irritable, asking premium for everything... can't see the lyrics, can't add to queue, can't play a song in a loop, can't move forward or backward in any song and even in playlist it used to play song according to its own choice and ad after each music.... like the experience can't be get more horrible. It was so irritating and it's asking for premium for everything.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e4d1517c-b49c-48b3-82d7-5c8c1de04707\",\"review_text\":\"I like the app it's so much cooler than others music apps, Spotify is more better\"},{\"review_id\":\"b625c6a3-6443-4f38-8d99-568dc6c992a1\",\"review_text\":\"J uicy cochie\"},{\"review_id\":\"d02d846e-a307-4310-b72b-4a9bd7a7aa77\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify has enjoyable and songs with lyrics\"},{\"review_id\":\"53424efb-aa24-4f15-8421-b636f717ce12\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome out of this world\"},{\"review_id\":\"5d349652-c823-429e-b014-b3ffb999eca8\",\"review_text\":\"Over all this was good app to listen to music albums, but I gave 4 stars because the new update doesn't let you skip between music lyrics. It would be great if it is fixed in next update\"},{\"review_id\":\"844c04ab-7f37-4577-a1e8-749ec9945a93\",\"review_text\":\"New update of spotify is very disappointed you and you dont abel to have 1 star\"},{\"review_id\":\"6347a8bb-8f79-4097-ac50-b53d50af0e49\",\"review_text\":\"I love you❤️❤️❤️❤️\"},{\"review_id\":\"8b1b9373-a61c-422e-8b2e-40a0a6fc31f6\",\"review_text\":\"lyrics wont show no matter what, no matter wt song or no matter d time i reinstall\"},{\"review_id\":\"bcd0c807-2059-406f-a69c-e5068c1364f7\",\"review_text\":\"The old Spotify was better than the new update.\"},{\"review_id\":\"78ef492d-0911-4b24-b6ce-b23d04bcb165\",\"review_text\":\"Quran Sharif ki behurmati Musalman nahin bardasht Karega\"},{\"review_id\":\"8aa88f1f-a567-493a-b48c-a3074ec008f6\",\"review_text\":\"Try to access my gmail account Don't download the app\"}]}"
